// vu_kbsg.jsfx-inc v3.0 — Unified VU Meter Library for EON Studios ReaKit
// ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//
// REQUIREMENTS (host plugin must provide):
//   - freemem >= 440  (this library uses hardcoded addresses 0-437)
//   - zm_theme (int, 0-12) — set in @init, persist via @serialize
//   - zm_frame_r/g/b — set >= 0 to override frame color, -1 for theme default
//   - mouse_wheel — temporarily assign before calling zm_draw_meter for scrolling
//   - tau, dt, hv_speed — required by knobs_kbsg.jsfx-inc if also imported
//
// PUBLIC API:
//   zm_draw_meter(x, y, w, h, db_val, hold_db, over_flag, theme_idx, mode)
//   zm_draw_stereo(x, y, w, h, dbL, dbR, holdL, holdR, overL, overR, theme)
//   mtr_vu_real_mono(x, y, w, h, vu_mono, hold, over)
//   mtr_vu_real_stereo(x, y, w, h, vu_l, vu_r, hold_l, hold_r, over_l, over_r)
//   mtr_vu_real_draw(cx, cy, r, db_val, hold_db, over, mode)
//   mtr_vu_real_draw_gr(cx, cy, r, gr_db, hold_db, over)
//   vu_init(speed) / vu_init_gr(speed) — physics init
//   vu_sample(abs_in) / vu_gr_sample(gr_linear) — feed per sample
//
// MEMORY MAP (addresses 0-437, do NOT overlap):
//   10-20:   print[] (VU scale dB labels)
//   30-40:   pos[] (VU scale arc positions)
//   100-437: 25 theme color arrays × 13 slots
//
// ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//
// Three complete VU systems ported EXACTLY from their original sources:
//
//   1. TUKAN     — tk-vu_lib_d.jsfx-inc (demian d mod)
//                  Spring-mass physics + PNG face drawing
//
//   2. ZENOMOD   — VU Meter (ZenoMOD) v1.7.7 by ZenoMOD
//                  Spring-mass physics + 11 themed vector faces
//                  Credits: chris-s, aurelien, Lubomir I. Ivanov
//
//   3. LITEON    — VU Meter by Lubomir I. Ivanov (C) 2008-2009 GPL
//                  RMS ballistics + retro vector face
//
// Plus EON Studios adaptations:
//   4. EON Studios physics  — cleaned instance-based spring-mass
//   5. EON Studios faces    — custom Tukan-style + cleaned ZenoMOD face
//
// ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

@init


